CASE|direct_type_argument
=======================================================================================================
Invoking CPG generator in a separate process. Note that the new process will consume additional memory.
If you are importing a large codebase (and/or running into memory issues), please try the following:
1) exit joern
2) invoke the frontend: /Users/shayaunnejad/vibe-code/joern-oxidized/.local/astra-sprint/oracle/runtime/joern-cli/c2cpg.sh -J-Xmx4096m /Users/shayaunnejad/vibe-code/.codex-worktrees/joern-oxidized-astra-macro-cast-context/.local/macro-cast-context/boundaries/input/direct_type_argument --output /Users/shayaunnejad/vibe-code/.codex-worktrees/joern-oxidized-astra-macro-cast-context/.local/macro-cast-context/boundaries/oracle-workspace/workspace/direct_type_argument/cpg.bin.zip
